* Message statements, MEMBER and ?Mmic? (OCL-11)
// * 'PAYROLL Procedure Running'
// * 'It''s time to change the forms'
// * 'Printer ?1? is ready'
// * 0005
// MEMBER USER1-MESSAGES,LIBRARY-COMMLIB,USER2-MSGHELP
// * 0005
// IF SWITCH1-1 * 'Check the output'
